{"toolCallId":"call_37e426c0c7884a53923aa107f7b8217c","status":"completed","content":[{"type":"content","content":{"type":"text","text":"total 136\ndrwxr-xr-x@ 9 michelkerkmeester  wheel    288 25 Oct 21:13 .\ndrwxr-xr-x@ 7 michelkerkmeester  wheel    224 25 Oct 21:13 ..\n-rw-r--r--@ 1 michelkerkmeester  wheel   3451 25 Oct 21:13 acceptance-criteria.md\n-rw-r--r--@ 1 michelkerkmeester  wheel   9667 25 Oct 21:13 decision-record.md\n-rw-r--r--@ 1 michelkerkmeester  wheel    756 25 Oct 21:13 description.json\n-rw-r--r--@ 1 michelkerkmeester  wheel   6966 25 Oct 21:13 implementation-summary.md\n-rw-r--r--@ 1 michelkerkmeester  wheel  13673 25 Oct 21:13 plan.md\n-rw-r--r--@ 1 michelkerkmeester  wheel   9717 25 Oct 21:13 spec.md\n-rw-r--r--@ 1 michelkerkmeester  wheel   9171 25 Oct 21:13 tasks.md\n=== AI_PROTOCOLS rule ===\n643:## 10. AI_PROTOCOLS\n644-\n645-**Severity:** ERROR\n646-**Description:** Validates that Level 3 and 3+ specs include AI execution protocol sections for agent guidance. For Level 3+, missing protocol components are reported as errors.\n647-\n648-### Required for Level 3+\n649-\n650-| Component             | Location        | Purpose                           |\n651-| --------------------- | --------------- | --------------------------------- |\n652-| AI Execution section  | plan/tasks.md   | Main protocol header              |\n653-| Pre-Task Checklist    | plan/tasks.md   | Steps before starting any task    |\n654-| Execution Rules       | plan/tasks.md   | TASK-SEQ, TASK-SCOPE constraints  |\n655-| Status Format         | plan/tasks.md   | How to report progress            |\n656-| Blocked Protocol      | plan/tasks.md   | What to do when stuck             |\n657-\n658-### Scoring\n659-\n660-- Level 3: Should have protocol section (warning if missing)\n661-- Level 3+: Must have at least 3/4 components (error if fewer)\n662-- Phase parent: skipped. Under the lean trio policy its `plan.md` and `tasks.md` live in the child folders, which carry the protocol.\n663-\n664-### Detection Patterns\n665-\n666-```markdown\n667-## AI EXECUTION PROTOCOL         ← Main section\n668-### Pre-Task Checklist           ← Component 1\n669-### Execution Rules              ← Component 2\n670-### Status Reporting Format      ← Component 3\n671-### Blocked Task Protocol        ← Component 4\n672-```\n673-\n"}}],"_meta":{"cognition.ai/cwd":"/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-michelkerkmeester-MEGA-Development-Code-Environment-Public/fcd93cd7-b3f2-45e6-b976-87fabe792df3/scratchpad/speed-loop/w1eb206b128/tree","terminal_exit":{"terminal_id":"d16083","exit_code":0,"signal":null},"cognition.ai/inferenceToolName":"exec"}}
